            <article class="pk-insight-card"><div class="pk-insight-card-copy"><span class="pk-eyebrow">Analytics</span><h3>@(tr ? "Gönderdik mi değil, ne oldu?" : "Not just whether it was sent — what happened?")</h3><p>@(tr ? "Kampanya ve Journey performansını, desteklenen kanal etkileşimlerini ve attribution bağlamını birlikte okuyun. Attribution ilişki kurar; nedenselliği otomatik olarak kanıtlamaz." : "Read Campaign and Journey performance, supported channel engagement and attribution context together. Attribution establishes association; it does not automatically prove causality.")</p><a class="pk-text-link" href="@(tr ? "/platform/analytics" : "/en/platform/analytics")">@(tr ? "Analytics'i inceleyin" : "Explore Analytics") <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a></div><div class="pk-insight-card-visual"><img src="/wiki/assets/images/img_bi-kokpit_5.png" alt="@(tr ? "Pika BI ve analitik kokpit ekranı" : "Pika BI and analytics cockpit")" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="760" /></div></article>
